# Help Desk Ticket Management System

A web-based **Help Desk Ticket Management System** built using **ASP.NET Core MVC** that helps organizations efficiently create, manage, track, assign, and resolve support tickets through a centralized platform.

---

## About the Project

The Help Desk Ticket Management System is designed to simplify and organize the process of handling support requests. Users can raise tickets for their issues, while administrators or support staff can manage tickets, assign them to appropriate personnel, set priorities, update statuses, and resolve issues efficiently.

The system provides a structured workflow that improves communication between users and support teams, reduces response time, and maintains a complete history of support requests.

---

##  Features

* User Authentication and Authorization
* Create and Submit Support Tickets
* View and Manage Tickets
* Assign Tickets to Support Staff
* Set Ticket Priority
* Categorize Support Issues
* Update Ticket Status
* Resolve and Close Tickets
* Search and Filter Tickets
* Centralized Ticket Management
* Maintain Ticket History
* Responsive and User-Friendly Interface

